SUMMARY:Muskoka Rescue Dogs Hike
DESCRIPTION:Wilderness Union Toronto - Outdoor Adventure and Hiking Club\n
 **Please note the only way to register for this adventure is on [our websi
 te.](https://www.wildernessunion.com/adventures/rescue-dog-hike-26)**\n\n*
 *Join us for a spectacular spring hike through the Muskoka wilderness alon
 gside some very special rescue pups!**\n\nWe’ll meet our four-legged gui
 des from a local rescue for a gentle 7 km journey along the winding Muskok
 a River. It is a rare chance to both get out of the city and give these do
 gs some well-deserved love & adventure.\n\nThe team from the rescue will j
 oin us to share stories about the dogs and the incredible work that goes i
 nto finding them forever homes. After the hike\, we will offer plenty of h
 ead scratches before heading to a nearby waterfall for a peaceful lunch. I
 t is the perfect setting to switch off and soak in the stillness of the wo
 ods.\n\nThis will be a relaxed three-hour walk on mostly flat terrain\, ac
 cessible for various fitness levels.\n\n*$10 from each registrant's advent
 ure payment will be donated to the rescue to support them in their goal of
  finding good forever homes for dogs in need.*\n\n**Please note that to ke
 ep the rescue dogs calm and focused\, we do not allow personal pets.**\n\n
 **Highlights**\n**Rescue Dogs -** Meet your furry companion for the day th
 anks to our local rescue partner.\n**Waterfalls -** Multiple cascading wat
 erfalls to be found throughout our lunch time destination\n**Muskoka Magic
  -** Rich forests and a sprawl of countless lakes await\n\n**Event cost: $
 70+HST - optional transport available.**\n**Register [here.](https://www.w
 ildernessunion.com/adventures/rescue-dog-hike-26)**\n\n**About Wilderness 
 Union**\nWilderness Union is deliberate about building an outdoors communi
 ty that connects you to the life-changing magic of the outdoors and helps 
 you find your people.\n\nMembers range from 20-40 years old. The group is 
 a mix of GTA locals and newcomers to Toronto from within Canada and abroad
 .\n\nAttendance numbers on Meetup don't reflect our actual event attendanc
 e - we typically have 15-20 community members at each event. Large enough 
 that there's someone new to meet but small enough that it's not overwhelmi
 ng!\n\n***Learn more at our website [www.wildernessunion.com](https://www.
 wildernessunion.com/)***
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/wildernessunion/events/314285470/
